  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></math> are coplanar then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />Now, normal vector will be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, equation of plane is given by,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now finding perpendicular distance from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>81</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>121</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
